      en: ["Maliana is located approximately 149 kilometers southwest of Dili.", "The surrounding area is the most significant rice-producing region in the country.", "The nearby Mota'ain crossing handles the highest volume of land-based international trade.", "Maliana hosts a major weekly market that attracts traders from across the island.", "The Maliana plains feature extensive irrigation systems modernized with foreign aid.", "The trade center is a key collection point for cattle exported to Indonesian markets."],
      es: ["Construido en 2016 con 8 millones de dólares de financiación del ADB.", "Volumen de negocio comercial anual: más de 15 millones de dólares.", "Empleados directos: 120 personas.", "Superficie de manipulación: 5 hectáreas.", "Tiempo de despacho de aduanas: 2 horas de media.", "Proyecto de ampliación previsto para 2025 con 10.000 m² de superficie logística."],
