      en: ["Ermera is the origin of the 'Hibrido de Timor,' a unique natural coffee hybrid.", "The cooperative supports a network of over 20,000 registered farming families.", "Coffee is traditionally grown under the protective canopy of Albizia shade trees.", "The CCT cooperative manages 8 health clinics serving rural coffee communities.", "Timor-Leste coffee is a key ingredient in specialty blends for global retailers.", "The annual harvest season in Ermera peaks between June and September."],
      es: ["Fundada en 2001 con 1.200 miembros.", "Superficie: 800 hectáreas.", "Capacidad de la planta: 500 toneladas.", "Mercados de exportación: Australia, Japón, Europa.", "Producción anual: 300 toneladas.", "Certificación Fair Trade desde 2005."],
      pt: ["Fundada em 2001 com 1.200 membros.", "Área: 800 hectares.", "Capacidade da fábrica: 500 toneladas.", "Mercados de exportação: Austrália, Japão, Europa.", "Produção anual: 300 toneladas.", "Certificação Fair Trade desde 2005."],
      fr: ["Fondée en 2001 avec 1 200 membres.", "Superficie : 800 hectares.", "Capacité de l'usine : 500 tonnes.", "Marchés d'exportation : Australie, Japon, Europe.", "Production annuelle : 300 tonnes.", "Certification Fair Trade depuis 2005."],
